Description: Slice ChIP-seq/ATAC-seq peaks and perform differential analysis.
   Peak counts are prepared, imported, normalized, visualized using MA-plots
   for data QC. Statistical groups are defined and used for differential
   analysis. Final visualizations include Venn diagrams, volcano plots,
   genomic region pie and bar charts, and signal heatmaps.
